<h3>About OER Training &amp; Development</h3>

<p>A collection of materials to help with the development of Open Educational Resources and to train individuals in understanding and utilizing them.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<h3><img alt="VALE OTN Resources" src="http://middlesexcc.sobeklibrary.com/design/aggregations/oer/uploads/Screen Shot 2019-03-07 at 7.10.47 PM.png" style="float:left; height:132px; width:222px" /></h3>

<p><a href="http://digital.middlesexcc.edu/l/contains/?t=%22Virtual+Academic+Library+Environment+(VALE)%22&amp;f=AU" target="_BLANK">Virtual Academic Library Environment</a>&nbsp;(VALE) sponsored the Open Textbook Network&#39;s Train the Trainer workshops on February 28 and March 1, 2019 at Middlesex County College, NJ.</p>

<p>The materials from those sessions are held in this collection. Each item has a Creative Commons license, and may be remixed and shared as indicated.</p>

<p>See the <a href="https://vale.njedge.net/initiatives-services/oer-open-educational-resources/" target="_blank">VALE OER initiatives page</a> for more information.<a href="http://digital.middlesexcc.edu/l/oer/contains/?t=%22VALE-OTN%20OER%20Materials%22&amp;f=TO">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </a></p>

